4:["$","main",null,{"className":"blog-page","children":[["$","$Le",null,{}],["$","article",null,{"className":"blog-article","children":["$","div",null,{"className":"shell blog-article-shell","children":[["$","$Lf",null,{"className":"blog-back-link","href":"/blog","children":[["$","$L10",null,{"ref":"$undefined","iconNode":[["path",{"d":"m12 19-7-7 7-7","key":"1l729n"}],["path",{"d":"M19 12H5","key":"x3x0zl"}]],"className":"lucide-arrow-left","size":16}]," All guides"]}],["$","p",null,{"className":"blog-tag","children":["Funding"," · ","One Window archive"]}],["$","h1",null,{"children":"HDFC Credila Education Loan for Study Abroad"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"blog-article-intro","children":"HDFC credila education loan allow for individuals, at undergraduate as well as more advanced academic stages, to pursue their educational goals without having to stress about finances. A trusted education loan provider such as HDFC Credilacan help you realise your dreams of studying overseas. With student loans from HDFC Credila, thousands of Indian students arepursuing 1800 courses in3400 academic institutes located across 50 countries."}],["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-article-body","children":[["$","section","Advantages on Offer",{"children":[["$","h2",null,{"children":"Advantages on Offer"}],[["$","p","Read on to understand the advantages an education loan from",{"children":"Read on to understand the advantages an education loan from"}],["$","p","HDFC Credila",{"children":"HDFC Credila"}],["$","p","provides:",{"children":"provides:"}]],["$","ul",null,{"children":[]}]]}],["$","section","Sanction Letter before Admission",{"children":[["$","h2",null,{"children":"Sanction Letter before Admission"}],[["$","p","– You can get a sanction letter for your education loan prior to being admitted to the academic institution of your choice. This makes for a great incentive, as your university may need to see proof of your ability to finance your education.",{"children":"– You can get a sanction letter for your education loan prior to being admitted to the academic institution of your choice. This makes for a great incentive, as your university may need to see proof of your ability to finance your education."}],["$","p","Tax Benefits",{"children":"Tax Benefits"}],["$","p","– Under Section 80E of the Income Tax Act, 1961, there is no upper cap on the interest paid on an education loan*. A loan from HDFC Credila is advantageous, as it is the sole non-banking financial company in India to offer this attractive tax benefit. Know more about the applicable tax savings, by taking advantage of the tax calculator available on the HDFC Credila website.",{"children":"– Under Section 80E of the Income Tax Act, 1961, there is no upper cap on the interest paid on an education loan*. A loan from HDFC Credila is advantageous, as it is the sole non-banking financial company in India to offer this attractive tax benefit. Know more about the applicable tax savings, by taking advantage of the tax calculator available on the HDFC Credila website."}]],["$","ul",null,{"children":[]}]]}],["$","section","All Expenses Covered",{"children":[["$","h2",null,{"children":"All Expenses Covered"}],[["$","p","– Beyond your tuition fees, you also need to account for your living expenses along with ancillary costs, such as travel expenses, purchasing a laptop etc. A student loan from HDFC Credila includes these expenses, thus taking away any possible stress around finances.",{"children":"– Beyond your tuition fees, you also need to account for your living expenses along with ancillary costs, such as travel expenses, purchasing a laptop etc. A student loan from HDFC Credila includes these expenses, thus taking away any possible stress around finances."}],"$L11","$L12"],"$L13"]}],"$L14","$L15","$L16"]}],"$L17"]}]}],"$L18"]}]
