12:["$","p","– What serves as perhaps the most pertinent aspect of academic loans brought forth by HDFC Credila is the fact that the loan does not require you to chip in any margin money, something a lot of other lenders mandate.",{"children":"– What serves as perhaps the most pertinent aspect of academic loans brought forth by HDFC Credila is the fact that the loan does not require you to chip in any margin money, something a lot of other lenders mandate."}]
